      "rationale": "A binary 'staff praised' flag is directly on-topic for identifying advantage attributes of high-rated airlines and gives a clean axis to group/compare on (partly overlaps the original 'Staff Service' rating, but the text-derived explicit-praise signal is distinct). Positives that appear (S1, S5) are well grounded, but S3 ('staff well-trained on hospitality') was missed and coded 0, a false negative that contradicts the text; no invented positives observed."
