      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Useful advantage axis relevant to the query. Correctly fires in S1 and S3 and correctly stays 0 in S2/S5. However S4, where food was the explicit highlight ('What amazed me most was how much food was available - 2 full meals'), was coded 0, a clear miss that undercuts groundedness. No fabricated positives."
