      "source_groundedness": 0.9,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Directly useful advantage attribute for the query. Values track the text well across all samples: 1 for 'legroom spacious' (S1), 'comfortable flight' (S4), 'seat was comfortable' (S5); correctly 0 for the 'seats dreadful' review (S2). No unsupported assertions."
    },
    {
      "name": "adv_entertainment",
